cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the Adver-City paper whose dataset methodology it follows,
  and the CARLA simulator.
title: CARLA Adverse-Weather Depth Dataset
abstract: >-
  Generation code for a multi-town, multi-weather monocular-depth dataset recorded in CARLA 0.9.12,
  providing four camera views per frame with semantic labels, sky masks, and LiDAR-projected sparse
  and semi-dense depth. The sensor rig and weather parameters follow the methodology of Adver-City.
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Adver-City: Open-Source Multi-Modal Dataset for Collaborative Perception Under Adverse
      Weather Conditions
    authors:
